ession' and 'Ownership' resonated deeply with how I approach my work. I also reached out to three Amazon employees on LinkedIn to learn about the day-to-day culture. I prepared examples from my career that directly demonstrated these principles."}]]}],["$","div","Result",{"className":"bg-neutral-50 rounded-xl p-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"bg-purple-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded mb-2 inline-block","children":"Result"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed mt-2","children":"I was able to give a specific, informed answer that showed genuine alignment rather than generic praise. The interviewer noted my answer stood out because I referenced real conversations with Amazonians and connected my past work to specific principles."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800 mb-2","children":"💡 Tips for this answer"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-1","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"text-sm text-amber-700 flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"•"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Reference specific Leadership Principles that resonate with you."}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"text-sm text-amber-700 flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"•"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Mention conversations with current Amazon employees if you've had them."}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"text-sm text-amber-700 flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"•"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Connect your personal work style to Amazon's culture of ownership."}]]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 p-6 md:p-8","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-6","children":["$L24","$L25"]}],"$L26","$L27"]}],"$L28"]}]]}]}]
